# Third-party compile-only mod jars (modCompileOnly). These are other
# projects' redistributables under their own licenses (several ARR); they are
# never shipped inside our jar and are provided at runtime by the pack, so they
# are not tracked here. Keep the files present locally to compile.
libs/

